# U43: inputs the import box rejects or rewrites. Typed text that is no code ("Invalid input"
# after every keystroke: Inflate fails), a youtube redirect whose q= parameter is a pobb.in link
# (UrlDecode, SetText of the nested URL: "URL is valid (pobb.in)"), a pastebin link whose download
# fails (the recorded 404: "Response code: 404" in NEGATIVE, importCodeValid false), and a
# snapshot (the build is unchanged).
#! u43-expect-label Invalid input
#! u43-expect-label URL is valid (Pastebin.com)
#! u43-expect-label URL is valid (pobb.in)
#! u43-expect-label Response code: 404
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
fixture net=net.json
frames 2
move 400 91
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
key-down CTRL
press i
key-up CTRL
frames 2
move 492 528
click LEFTBUTTON
type "garbage!"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press a
key-up CTRL
paste-clipboard "https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video&q=https%3A%2F%2Fpobb.in%2Fabc_D-1&v=x"
key-down CTRL
press v
key-up CTRL
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press a
key-up CTRL
paste-clipboard "https://pastebin.com/u43Missing"
key-down CTRL
press v
key-up CTRL
frames 2
press RETURN
frames 1
frames 3
snapshot errors
frames 1
